安装路径：/Users/ruoke/Documents/devTools/apache-jmeter-5.6.3/bin&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>Nginx</title><link>https://ruokezhang.github.io/zh-cn/post/nginx/</link><pubDate>Thu, 30 Jan 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://ruokezhang.github.io/zh-cn/post/nginx/</guid><description>&lt;h2 id="cli">CLI
